cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite both the archived release and the manuscript."
title: "A five-gene signature for hepatocellular carcinoma: analysis code"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for the derivation and validation of a five-gene transcriptomic signature
  (CDKN2A, CCT6A, CSTB, ACLY, EPRS1) that discriminates hepatocellular carcinoma from adjacent
  liver tissue, stratifies prognosis and characterises the tumour immune microenvironment.
